# Decision-oriented UX

Optimize for a Portfolio Director or PM finishing J1–J3, not for a landing page.

- Lead with decision verbs: escalate, review, acknowledge, flag, mark needs steer.
- Portfolio must answer “which 1–3 projects get attention today?” in one scan (rank + filters).
- Two clicks from a red row to *why* (drivers / issue detail).
- Implement empty states when a domain has no issues.
- Desktop-first (1280+), dense tables and KPI strips. Do not add illustration-heavy chrome.
- Session-only controls (`needsSteer`, cost review flag) must say they do not persist.
